<title>HUNGARY: Hungary net foreign debt down to $12.6 bln in Nov.</title>
<headline>Hungary net foreign debt down to $12.6 bln in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's net foreign debt narrowed to $12.6 billion at the end of November from $12.7 billion at the end of October, the National Bank of Hungary said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
